Drop the private here-now chip; new footer

The archive's own live count is gone from the page along with the owner token
and the hub heartbeat -- only the scraped "people in these gallis right now"
ticker remains. Badge counts for the archived sites are untouched.

Footer loses the thread credit and the missing-credits note, and becomes
"made with love, using Claude" with the Claude mark. The footer and the socials
strip now carry the same frosted glass as the masthead and filter rail.

